CM_ SG_ 1402 driver_steering_FF_cmd "driver setting of FF gain. FF gain gets multiplied to the duty cycle output of the FF table on raptor.
FF table on raptor is linear interpolation of 
-100% to +100% corresponding -720 deg/s to +720 deg/s (Which is the maximum no load RPM of the motor) 
The table is also adjustible but not online
";
