CM_ SG_ 1304 target_speed_multi_car_race "This signal outputs expected speed from the car when running in multicar race with push2pass rules. Not to implemented unless communicated. This is a backup strategy in case if we think throttle saturation based P2P is not viable.

This speed request will ONLY switch between floor and ceiling speeds as directed by the P2P state machine. Unit will be in MPH  ";
